      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0012",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The example above collects timestamps generated on a one-second [`Timer`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/Timer) in groups (`Stride`) of five.",
      "normalizedSource": "The example above collects timestamps generated on a one-second [`Timer`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/Timer) in groups (`Stride`) of five.",
