      "normalizedSource": "```swift let sub = Timer.publish(every: 1, on: .main, in: .default) .autoconnect() .collect(.byTime(RunLoop.main, .seconds(5))) .sink { print(\"\\($0)\", terminator: \"\\n\\n\") } // Prints: \"[2020-01-24 00:54:46 +0000, 2020-01-24 00:54:47 +0000, // 2020-01-24 00:54:48 +0000, 2020-01-24 00:54:49 +0000, // 2020-01-24 00:54:50 +0000]\" ```",
